unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, July to August is the driest pair of months on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, and it came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years since 1951. On the middle of the grids, June to July 2025 came in at 11% of normal. So far in 2026, May to June and June to July each sit at 41% on the middle of the grids. Grid 25572 had its driest year in 2020 at 53%.</p>"}
